# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# --- COMMIT MESSAGE TYPES ---
# feat: New feature
# fix: Bug fix
# test: Add/update test cases
# refactor: Code refactoring without changing functionality
# docs: Update documentation
# style: Code style changes (formatting, semicolons, etc)
# chore: Dependencies or build updates
#
# --- EXAMPLES ---
# test(loginPopup): add test for email validation
# fix(jobApplyPage): handle CV upload timeout
# docs(README): update installation instructions
# refactor(commonUtils): extract screenshot logic
